<title>USA: France says G7 against Russia as full member.</title>
<headline>France says G7 against Russia as full member.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>France said on Friday there was a consensus among the Group of Seven industrialized nations against full membership in the exclusive club for Russia.</p>
<p>&quot;There is a consensus among the Group of Seven rich nations that they need to continue meeting without Russia to discuss economic and financial issues,&quot; said a spokeswoman for French President Jacques Chirac.</p>
</text>
